  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Aurora bursts in the east as a beautiful palace flies toward Iron Eagle blessed land in Northern Plains; watching immortals call that Gong tribe has arrived and brought Golden Dawn Hall. Outside the house, Gong Er invites others to attack Hei tribe together; Bai Zu tribe’s three Gu Immortals enter as guests when the rest of the righteous path stays put.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_gong_tribe",
        "char_gong_er",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the sky of Iron Eagle blessed land, Golden Dawn Hall keeps floating at its spot, shining with dazzling golden light, while Gong tribe and Bai Zu tribe Gu Immortals talk inside.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-station",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gong Er sits inside Golden Dawn Hall looking down on the eagle fights, having brought the house to gain great benefits on this trip.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "interior-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the final moments of the Hei tribe battle, Gong Er wants to use Golden Dawn Hall to snatch resources inside, but a message from Prince Feng Xian stops him from acting against Heavenly Lord Bai Zu. He had mobilized the house to control the situation and lead the righteous path; other Huang Jin bloodline Gu Immortals paid him no heed, and only Bai Zu tribe’s three Gu Immortals entered as guests with hidden intentions.",
      "chapters": [
        1110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "resource-snatch-attempt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Above Blood Plain, Gong tribe’s Golden Dawn Hall appears as a hall shining with brilliant golden radiance beside Nu Er tribe’s Loud Thunder Hall. Gong Wan Ting accepts the Longevity Edict after three offers and places it at the center of the plaque on the entrance, then invites the immortals inside.",
      "chapters": [
        1193
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_blood_plain",
        "fac_nu_er_tribe",
        "house_loud_thunder_hall",
        "char_gong_wan_ting",
        "gu_longevity_edict"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chu Du’s side arrives, Loud Thunder Hall stands to the right, Golden Dawn Hall at the center, and Divine Light Hall to the left.",
      "chapters": [
        1194
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-house-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Golden Dawn Hall floats quietly in the air over Blood Plain, standing majestically and unmoved while battles rage outside, and righteous path immortals watch from inside with smiles as Ye Lui Qun Xing presses Chu Du’s side.",
      "chapters": [
        1201
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-observation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Golden Dawn Hall is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Gong tribe, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
